     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-promise-2017-06-28#:~:text=Serving%20Rhonas%20was%20my%20purpose%20in%20life."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Convinced of the myth, Rhonas welcomed the Hours and went to the Gate to greet the God-Pharaoh, who never arrived.",
    "cites": [
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e1",
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e2"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=Rhonas%20rejoiced%2C%20emerging%20from,temple%20and%20his%20Trial.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=The%20five%20stood%20before,shores%20of%20the%20Luxa"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "When three insect-headed gods awoke, Rhonas challenged the scorpion god and felled it with a poisoned staff, but it grappled him from behind and pierced his skull with its tail sting.",
    "cites": [
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e4",
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e5",
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e7",
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e8"
    ],
