     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=Without%20warning%2C%20the%20scorpion%20god%20charged%20toward%20Rhonas",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=venom%20powerful%20enough%20to%20slay%20most%20living%20things",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=the%20scorpion%20tail%2C%20arched,piercing%20his%20own%20skull."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "As he died he remembered the true history of the corrupted gods, named Nicol Bolas, recognized the scorpion god as one of his corrupted brothers, and cursed the God-Pharaoh.",
    "cites": [
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e9",
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e10",
     "hour-glory-2017-06-21-e12",
