     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=the%20original%20light%20and,buried%20beneath%20vile%20corruption.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/hour-glory-2017-06-21#:~:text=Death%20to%20the%20God%2DPharaoh%2C%20foul%20trespasser%20and%20destroyer%21"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "His final spell turned his staff into a serpent that wrestled the scorpion god, and later a khenra warrior wielded the reforged staff against it.",
